{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S01\",\"screen\":\"他想往前过日子却总被旧时光牵回，不知以后靠什么安心\",\"source\":\"偶尔想起从前熟悉的日子，他还是想往前过，却不知道以后靠什么让自己安下心。\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿只是偶尔想起从前，屏幕稿改成总被旧时光牵回，增加了持续被过去牵绊、难以向前的状态。\"},{\"sec\":\"S05\",\"screen\":\"像几次深呼吸，紧绷松开一点只是累了\",\"source\":\"这一下松动，也像是“不是已经想通了，而是抵抗得累了”。\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿将疲惫作为一种可能的听感，屏幕稿用“只是”将这一解释变成了确定结论。\"},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"试探的步子渐聚拢，祈祷般的声音变成行动\",\"source\":\"祈祷开始变成意志。\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿表达的是内在意志开始形成，屏幕稿改成行动，容易让人理解为已经从内心决心转向实际行动。\"},{\"sec\":\"S13\",\"screen\":\"他会珍惜愿接纳他的人，没人接纳也独自过好不吞委屈\",\"source\":\"将来要是再有人愿意把他当自己人，他会好好珍惜；即使一直没有，他也愿意自己好好过下去，不再为了留住谁把那些委屈咽下去。\",\"type\":\"8\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"“愿接纳他”比“愿意把他当自己人”含义更笼统，弱化了原文中特别强调的归属感和被当作自己人的亲近关系。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9199acf7-146b-4bcb-8c32-4fc89320c978", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T195556085056Z", "elapsed_seconds": 269.171, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T20:00:25.269412+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d1642afa892999924cbd74f5e99ea0dcbad5d046f2f5f87574108e5f33812f1d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used":